	(text "Byte timing (FC2): BC=0..3 QSTB byte0..byte3, BC=3 also DONE;\nthe S09 byte counter increments on each QSTB and addresses\nneuron*4+byte.  BC[1:0] is the byte index.  FC1 stops at BC=0:\nQSTB and DONE are the same cycle, then RUN clears.\nNo bias adder; FC2 raw ACC is already the signed score used by Argmax."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e1a5d015-5ef0-4f31-ab86-f09aa3fc0df4")
	)

